{
    "version": 6,
    "bundle": "N3OBVHWT2FI7ZRJOC4EGTF33LRXDRVRM",
    "type": "story",
    "storyId": "020002101",
    "title": "負けられない2人　春の天皇賞",
    "enTitle": "",
    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "実況",
            "enName": "Commentator",
            "jpText": "ライスシャワーだ！　ライスシャワーが意地を見せた！\nみごと1着でゴールインっ！！",
            "enText": "It's Rice Shower! Rice Shower did not back down! An excellent finish \nin first!",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "origClipLength": 199,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": -3500828227715086765,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "春の『天皇賞』を見据えた『日経賞』。\r\nライスシャワーはかつての走りを取り戻し、1着でゴール――",
            "enText": "With the Tenno Sho right around the corner, Rice runs like her old \nself again at the Nikkei Sho.",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "origClipLength": 107,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "pathId": -2308949502171226856,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "そして、その好走に応えるかのように\r\nメジロマックイーンも『大阪杯』をコースレコードで勝利――",
            "enText": "And as if galvanized by that performance, McQueen takes the Osaka \nHai in course-record time.",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "origClipLength": 106,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "pathId": 3892620830981172838,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "メジロマックイーンとライスシャワーは互いを意識し合いながら、\r\n今まで以上に過酷なトレーニングを重ねていった。",
            "enText": "They've both been training harder than ever, pushing each other to \ngreater heights.",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "origClipLength": 116,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "pathId": -5772256165251775920,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "そして春の『天皇賞』、当日――",
            "enText": "And before long, the day of the Tenno Sho arrives.",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "origClipLength": 64,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "pathId": -9185382876269497033,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "実況",
            "enName": "Commentator",
            "jpText": "2枠3番、ミホノブルボンの三冠を阻んだ漆黒のステイヤー、\nライスシャワーです！",
            "enText": "In bracket two, post three, it's the sable stayer who denied Mihono \nBourbon her Triple Crown — Rice Shower!",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "origClipLength": 215,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 141,
                    "pathId": -8325993239311627492
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 21,
                    "pathId": 5983630268158929025
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 4231068411418942601,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ライスシャワー",
            "enName": "Rice Shower",
            "jpText": "マックイーンさんについてく……ついてく……。",
            "enText": "Just follow McQueen… Just keep following…",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "origClipLength": 97,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 141,
                    "pathId": 5806059541536430621
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 88,
                    "pathId": -9063217833860753579
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 6073849728000409464,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "多くの人を前にしても、\r\nライスシャワーのまっすぐな眼差しはそのままだった。",
            "enText": "Unfazed by the huge crowd before her, Rice fixes her gaze on \nMcQueen.",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "origClipLength": 94,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 141,
                    "pathId": 691687353122063197
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 182,
                    "pathId": 1740793256793983566
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 7570826789529348434,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "メジロマックイーンに勝ちたいという想いが、\r\n見ているこちらにまで伝わってくる。",
            "enText": "She wants to win against her rival more than anything else. Her eyes \nare telling me so.",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "origClipLength": 97,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 141,
                    "pathId": 4839820832289237906
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 182,
                    "pathId": 2225106202872824106
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 1569333498654268651,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "そして、圧倒的な1番人気はやはり――",
            "enText": "Meanwhile, the crowd favorite is, of course…",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "origClipLength": 68,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 34,
                    "pathId": -9093943989935785229
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 182,
                    "pathId": -5865550392550296330
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 109,
                    "pathId": -3821294689549546038
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1893019529988490785,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "実況",
            "enName": "Commentator",
            "jpText": "8枠14番1番人気、春の『天皇賞』3連覇という偉業へ挑む\r\n王者メジロマックイーンです！",
            "enText": "In bracket eight, post fourteen, today's favorite with a third straight \nspring Tenno Sho on the line, it's the queen herself — Mejiro \nMcQueen!",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "origClipLength": 265,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 220,
                    "pathId": 3620446046303992789
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 123,
                    "pathId": 3496971718240072048
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 911926522735235119,
            "blockIdx": 11
        },
        {
            "jpName": "歓声",
            "enName": "Vociferations",
            "jpText": "（ワアアァァァーッ！！）",
            "enText": "<i>Wooo!</i>",
            "nextBlock": 13,
            "origClipLength": 85,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 155,
                    "pathId": 7204355861552729659
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 91,
                    "pathId": -6097658313186687017
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -7387929574142913478,
            "blockIdx": 12
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "今日一番の歓声を前にしても、\r\n決してうろたえることのないメジロマックイーン。",
            "enText": "The loudest fanfare of the day resounds for her, but McQueen \ndoesn't seem to hear.",
            "nextBlock": 14,
            "origClipLength": 95,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 155,
                    "pathId": 7221976872002766805
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 186,
                    "pathId": 6032322797139799788
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1289124411053866780,
            "blockIdx": 13
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "彼女もまた、必ず勝つという強い意志があるからだろう。",
            "enText": "Like her rival, she's focused on one thing, and one thing \nonly — victory.",
            "nextBlock": 15,
            "origClipLength": 78,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 155,
                    "pathId": -4186694134656329247
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 186,
                    "pathId": -487512259426888873
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 5073096163965385633,
            "blockIdx": 14
        },
        {
            "jpName": "<username>",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "すごい歓声だったね。",
            "enText": "The crowd's excited to see you.",
            "nextBlock": 16,
            "origClipLength": 58,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 129,
                    "pathId": 3920043681665069364
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 186,
                    "pathId": -2242160106345253544
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4464607766482843372,
            "blockIdx": 15
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロマックイーン",
            "enName": "Mejiro McQueen",
            "jpText": "あら、トレーナーさん。\nライスさんのところへは、行かなくていいのですか？",
            "enText": "Oh, Trainer. Shouldn't you be going to check up on Rice?",
            "nextBlock": 17,
            "origClipLength": 165,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 196,
                    "pathId": -2225908977638178341
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 6260757132353369558
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -2158672273287630578,
            "blockIdx": 16
        },
        {
            "jpName": "<username>",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "マックイーンのトレーナーでもあるから。",
            "enText": "I'm your trainer too, you know.",
            "nextBlock": 18,
            "origClipLength": 69,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 196,
                    "pathId": -5026986076695335955
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 3928104779134207581,
            "blockIdx": 17
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロマックイーン",
            "enName": "Mejiro McQueen",
            "jpText": "ふふっ、トレーナーの鑑ですわね。\nですが、ライスさんのところに行ってあげてくださいませ。",
            "enText": "Heh. And I'm lucky to have such an exemplary one. But please, go see \nhow she's doing.",
            "nextBlock": 19,
            "origClipLength": 260,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 109,
                    "pathId": 3884196912402998387
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -6918517405308771957
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 3628021522276822186,
            "blockIdx": 18
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロマックイーン",
            "enName": "Mejiro McQueen",
            "jpText": "あれだけのトレーニングを積んで気持ちも充分でしょうけど、\r\nきっと不安もあるはずです。",
            "enText": "After all that training, I'm sure she's built up enough confidence, but \nshe must still be feeling anxious.",
            "nextBlock": 20,
            "origClipLength": 222,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 127,
                    "pathId": 2765104407565063378
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -7928823088721136261
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -2345548203602382925,
            "blockIdx": 19
        },
        {
            "jpName": "<username>",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "君こそエースの鑑だよ。\nライスのことをしっかりと考えてる。",
            "enText": "<i>I'm</i> lucky to have such an exemplary ace on my team. Always looking \nout for others, even a rival.",
            "nextBlock": 21,
            "origClipLength": 82,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 127,
                    "pathId": -5897516716099384453
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -6171349700941278025,
            "blockIdx": 20
        },
        {
            "jpName": "<username>",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "貴方こそエースの鑑だね。\r\nライスのことをしっかりと考えてる。",
            "enText": "<i>I'm</i> lucky to have such an exemplary ace on my team. Always looking \nout for others, even a rival.",
            "nextBlock": 22,
            "origClipLength": 85,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 127,
                    "pathId": 9216740476376418462
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 1118410818654898411,
            "blockIdx": 21
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロマックイーン",
            "enName": "Mejiro McQueen",
            "jpText": "ここではそうですが、ターフの上では違います。",
            "enText": "For now, yes. Out on the turf, I can't make any guarantees.",
            "nextBlock": 23,
            "origClipLength": 129,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 133,
                    "pathId": -6917103477586834049
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4770292712492655373,
            "blockIdx": 22
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロマックイーン",
            "enName": "Mejiro McQueen",
            "jpText": "私はこのレースに、全身全霊をかけて挑みます。\r\n一切手を抜くことはありません。",
            "enText": "I will put everything I have into this race. No holding back.",
            "nextBlock": 24,
            "origClipLength": 227,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 109,
                    "pathId": 6179096931297103544
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -428029314502291737
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 4796229564454870768,
            "blockIdx": 23
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロマックイーン",
            "enName": "Mejiro McQueen",
            "jpText": "皆さんが期待してくださる『天皇賞』3連覇……。\r\nその“期待”が、私にとってなによりの“力”です。",
            "enText": "The crowd are hoping to witness the birth of a three-time Tenno Sho \nchampion. And their hopes give me strength.",
            "nextBlock": 25,
            "origClipLength": 269,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 173,
                    "pathId": 6786047249492439922
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 21,
                    "pathId": 2024636271293526157
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -2570498480588705682,
            "blockIdx": 24
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロマックイーン",
            "enName": "Mejiro McQueen",
            "jpText": "必ず先頭でゴールを駆け抜けてみせますわ。",
            "enText": "I <i>will</i> be the first to cross that finish line.",
            "nextBlock": 26,
            "origClipLength": 96,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 121,
                    "pathId": -7470037804452461663
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3592078924907769234,
            "blockIdx": 25
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "その想いに一点の迷いもないことは、表情を見ればわかる。\r\nメジロマックイーンは偽りなく、全力で走るつもりだ。",
            "enText": "I can't detect a single trace of hesitation in her eyes. She means every \nword.",
            "nextBlock": 27,
            "origClipLength": 115,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "期待してるよ、マックイーン",
                    "enText": "Well, you can add my hopes in there as well.",
                    "nextBlock": 27
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 163,
                    "pathId": 1615022027836881700
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 2620061191160559790,
            "blockIdx": 26
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロマックイーン",
            "enName": "Mejiro McQueen",
            "jpText": "ええ、任せてくださいませ。",
            "enText": "Of course. I won't disappoint.",
            "nextBlock": 28,
            "origClipLength": 82,
            "voiceIdx": 11,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 109,
                    "pathId": -37635696909883223
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 30,
                    "pathId": -2263893425592335455
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 3617469851193037998,
            "blockIdx": 27
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "メジロマックイーンに言葉をかけ終ると、\r\nその前方を歩くライスシャワーの元へと駆け寄った。",
            "enText": "After speaking with McQueen, I jog ahead to Rice Shower.",
            "nextBlock": 29,
            "origClipLength": 103,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 99,
                    "pathId": -2149236355291620105
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 30,
                    "pathId": -4747021737655711692
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -5292525382957770427,
            "blockIdx": 28
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ライスシャワー",
            "enName": "Rice Shower",
            "jpText": "あ、トレーナーさん……。",
            "enText": "Oh, Trainer…",
            "nextBlock": 30,
            "origClipLength": 67,
            "voiceIdx": 12,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 99,
                    "pathId": -5670062494940899025
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 8620821484181111639,
            "blockIdx": 29
        },
        {
            "jpName": "<username>",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "緊張してないか？　リラックスするには、\nウマ娘って手のひらに3回書いて飲み込むといいらしいぞ。",
            "enText": "Nervous? The trick is to write \"horsegirl\" on your palm and swallow \nthe word three times.",
            "nextBlock": 31,
            "origClipLength": 106,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 161,
                    "pathId": -6218373653473449812
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 118,
                    "pathId": -4095556003708691669
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 4940367702997429589,
            "blockIdx": 30
        },
        {
            "jpName": "<username>",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "緊張してない？　リラックスするには、\r\nウマ娘って手のひらに3回書いて飲み込むといいらしいよ。",
            "enText": "Nervous? The trick is to write \"horsegirl\" on your palm and swallow \nthe word three times.",
            "nextBlock": 32,
            "origClipLength": 106,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 161,
                    "pathId": 4455379112884385751
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 118,
                    "pathId": 327100947451619840
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -8248581653263174037,
            "blockIdx": 31
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ライスシャワー",
            "enName": "Rice Shower",
            "jpText": "ふふふっ、そんなの聞いたことないよ。",
            "enText": "Heheheh. I've never heard that before.",
            "nextBlock": 33,
            "origClipLength": 106,
            "voiceIdx": 13,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 139,
                    "pathId": 440306831349090507
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 181,
                    "pathId": -815716088983497709
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 4125111578755205851,
            "blockIdx": 32
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ライスシャワー",
            "enName": "Rice Shower",
            "jpText": "緊張はね、そんなにしてないよ。\nだけど……やっぱりちょっと怖い。",
            "enText": "I'm not that nervous, actually. It's just… I'm a bit scared.",
            "nextBlock": 34,
            "origClipLength": 246,
            "voiceIdx": 14,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 52,
                    "pathId": -4577315179235617087
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 21,
                    "pathId": -4037657070542032645
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 908821631423440822,
            "blockIdx": 33
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ライスシャワー",
            "enName": "Rice Shower",
            "jpText": "たくさんの人がマックイーンさんを応援してて、\r\n『天皇賞』の3連覇を見たがってるのがよくわかるから。",
            "enText": "So many people are rooting for McQueen. I know how much they \nwant to see her third Tenno Sho win.",
            "nextBlock": 35,
            "origClipLength": 279,
            "voiceIdx": 15,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 312,
                    "pathId": 3856390484957101468
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -6808350599472904707
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -6185114131257643725,
            "blockIdx": 34
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ライスシャワー",
            "enName": "Rice Shower",
            "jpText": "ライスが勝ったらきっとまたみんなはガッカリして、\r\n『余計なことをするな』って怒るよね。",
            "enText": "If I win, they'll all be disappointed. They'll be angry with me for \ngetting in the way.",
            "nextBlock": 36,
            "origClipLength": 285,
            "voiceIdx": 16,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 297,
                    "pathId": 7734931377959344350
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -7096855641112249445
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -5895658921987596777,
            "blockIdx": 35
        },
        {
            "jpName": "<username>",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "そういう心配をするってことは、勝つ気は充分みたいだね。",
            "enText": "The fact you're worried about that tells me you're here to win.",
            "nextBlock": 37,
            "origClipLength": 80,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 297,
                    "pathId": 8250488187992932126
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -260683817406751880,
            "blockIdx": 36
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ライスシャワー",
            "enName": "Rice Shower",
            "jpText": "……うん、それでもやっぱりライスは勝ちたいから。",
            "enText": "…Yeah. I still want to win.",
            "nextBlock": 38,
            "origClipLength": 146,
            "voiceIdx": 17,
            "animData": [
                {
